    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever you attempt to endure a condition and are still affected by it, you can ignore any numerical penalties associated with the condition for as long as you maintain the meditate approach (although they can still prevent you from taking certain actions or activating abilities like fatigued preventing a barbarian's rage). The condition must be one which your active Body Control talent(s) specifically state you can endure.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/body-control#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
